{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Swami","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is a set of patch helpers — one per Origami patch, named after the patch, so an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"origami.Drag","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" becomes a "},{"code":".drag(…)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" modifier and an Interaction becomes "},{"code":".interaction(…)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"— plus a gallery of Origami prototypes translated to SwiftUI. The patches are the reusable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"part; each entry in the gallery shows those patches composed into a working view. Where"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI already has the right tool the translation uses it directly; where it doesn’t, a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch helper fills the gap."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Gallery","anchor":"Gallery","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"items":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Drag","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Pinch"],"type":"links","style":"detailedGrid"}]}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swami"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"Swami","roleHeading":"Framework","symbolKind":"module","role":"collection","modules":[{"name":"Swami"}],"externalID":"Swami"},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Patterns","identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Drag","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Pinch"],"title":"Patterns"},{"anchor":"Shapes","identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/RoundedTriangle"],"title":"Shape